487
00:19:39.887 --> 00:19:41.347
You know what?

488
00:19:41.389 --> 00:19:44.642
Fine. I will have dinner
with you.

489
00:19:44.725 --> 00:19:47.645
-Oh. wonderful. (CHUCKLES)
-You'll have to untie me first.

490
00:19:48.604 --> 00:19:51.273
A real relationship
is built on trust.

491
00:19:51.357 --> 00:19:52.817
That has to start now.

492
00:19:55.778 --> 00:19:59.240
Okay. (CHUCKLES)
Ooh. hey. you wike venison?

493
00:19:59.323 --> 00:20:02.368
-Mm.
-I make it with a cherwy gwaze.

494
00:20:02.451 --> 00:20:04.203
The key is low-heat weduction.

495
00:20:04.286 --> 00:20:06.205
-(GRUNTS)
-(GROANS)

496
00:20:06.247 --> 00:20:08.874
-♪ (GROOVY MUSIC PLAYING) ♪
-(GROANS. COUGHS)

497
00:20:08.916 --> 00:20:11.544
-You are a stupid. stupid...
-(GROANS)

498
00:20:11.585 --> 00:20:14.338
