502
00:20:23.806 --> 00:20:26.016
-(PANTS)
-♪ (QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

503
00:20:26.934 --> 00:20:28.102
Stay healthy.

504
00:20:29.603 --> 00:20:30.855
You too!

505
00:20:30.938 --> 00:20:33.733
♪ (SENTIMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

506
00:20:33.774 --> 00:20:35.276
-(PANTS)
-DENISE: Stuart!

507
00:20:35.359 --> 00:20:36.944
Oh. I'm so glad you're okay.

508
00:20:37.027 --> 00:20:38.070
I'm so glad you're okay.

509
00:20:38.154 --> 00:20:39.864
-(SOBS)
-(GRUNTS)

510
00:20:40.614 --> 00:20:41.949
-Uh. oh. sorry.
-DENISE: Oh!

511
00:20:42.032 --> 00:20:43.868
I'm covered with people.

512
00:20:43.909 --> 00:20:45.578
(MOCKINGLY)
Yeah. everybody's okay.

513
00:20:45.661 --> 00:20:48.456
-Let's go!
-♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

514
00:20:50.291 --> 00:20:52.126
