520
00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:06.265
It's a vari-state
quantum interference device!

521
00:21:06.348 --> 00:21:08.017
Mm. Could be both.

522
00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.894
-Can you fix it?
-Yes. I think so.

523
00:21:09.935 --> 00:21:11.771
-(DEVICE RUMBLES)
-Oh. calibration is off.

524
00:21:11.854 --> 00:21:13.606
-Gotta reconfigure.
-(DEVICE BEEPS)

525
00:21:13.689 --> 00:21:15.065
Change the inputs.

526
00:21:15.149 --> 00:21:16.525
BERT: What's supposed
to happen?

527
00:21:16.609 --> 00:21:18.986
-(DEVICE CHIRPS. HUMS)
-Does everything just go back
to the way it was?

528
00:21:19.069 --> 00:21:20.946
Yeah. fingers crossed.

529
00:21:20.988 --> 00:21:23.073
That would mean you and I
would be together again.

530
00:21:23.157 --> 00:21:25.284
Slow down. champ.
I'm still grieving.

531
00:21:25.326 --> 00:21:26.494
STUART: Hmm. hmm.

532
00:21:26.577 --> 00:21:29.121
